    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>一种只在地下迷宫中发现的怪物。其十根触手中有两根带有毒性。它以尚存活的生物的体液为食。由于没有牙齿，它会先用触手麻痹猎物，然后将触手伸入猎物体内，从内部吞噬。\n\n</p><p>曾在  <a href=\"/wiki/Queen%27s_Blade:_Sword_Of_The_Unicorn\" title=\"Queen&#39;s Blade: Sword Of The Unicorn\">女皇的刀刃：独角兽之剑</a>  第4章中出现。\n\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260821131628\nCache expiry: 1209600\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.004 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.007 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 0/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 1/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    0.000      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_queensblade:pcache:idhash:39501-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260821131628 and revision id 64412. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"
